{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42373","headline":"陈侍郎宅观花烛 · 徐铉","name":"陈侍郎宅观花烛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今夜银河万里秋，人言织女嫁牵牛。\n佩声寥亮和金奏，烛影荧煌映玉钩。\n座客亦从天子赐，更筹须爲主人留。\n世间盛事君知否，朝下鸾台夕凤楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}